# R4 through the real play window (W4-WIN-CLOSE C1): the occupancy index follows the picture's takes
# by their deltas, does nothing while the tool is off, ignores another island's edit (one
# comparison), and is reseeded once when the tool comes back. The counts are PlacementKnowledge's
# (rebuilds, deltas, tiles written, foreign deltas, batches seen while the tool was off); no timing.
# Run by tools/test/viewer_wiring.py; every `expect` fails the session if it is not met.
look 1052 444
# ---- the tool is off: edits of the city and of another island reach the picture, not the index -
expect work rebuilds == 0
expect work tiles == 0
local build 1307 1060 444
foreign build
wait turns 6
expect work rebuilds == 0
expect work deltas == 0
expect work tiles == 0
expect work foreign == 0
expect work off_batches >= 1
checkpoint off_edits_not_followed

# ---- the tool comes on: one reseed from the picture's per-island list ---------------------------
key b
wait frames 4
expect work rebuilds == 1
expect occupied 1060 444 yes
expect occupied 1068 444 no
note work tiles
note work rebuilds
checkpoint reseeded_once

# ---- an edit on another island: one comparison, no index work ----------------------------------
foreign demolish
wait turns 6
expect work foreign >= 1
expect work tiles same
expect work rebuilds same
expect work deltas == 0
checkpoint foreign_edit_ignored

# ---- a local build and demolish by the tool's own clicks: the tile deltas, no rebuild ----------
select 1307
rotate 0
click 1068 444
wait outcome
wait drawn
expect outcome Applied
expect work deltas >= 1
expect work rebuilds same
expect work tiles grew
expect occupied 1068 444 yes
note work tiles
checkpoint local_build_followed
key x
click 1068 444
wait outcome
wait drawn
expect work rebuilds same
expect work tiles grew
expect occupied 1068 444 no
checkpoint local_demolish_followed

# ---- off again: a local demolish and build are not followed; on again: one reseed ---------------
key b
note work deltas
note work tiles
local demolish 1060 444
local build 1307 1076 444
wait turns 6
expect work deltas same
expect work tiles same
expect work rebuilds same
checkpoint second_off_spell
key b
wait frames 4
expect work rebuilds grew
expect occupied 1060 444 no
expect occupied 1076 444 yes
checkpoint reseeded_again
quit
